  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orangered pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Thermic Capacitor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/59/Wendell_Vaughn_%28Realm_of_Kings%29_Quasar.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180426071026\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Wendell Vaughn (Realm of Kings) Quasar\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/59/Wendell_Vaughn_%28Realm_of_Kings%29_Quasar.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180426071026\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/59/Wendell_Vaughn_%28Realm_of_Kings%29_Quasar.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180426071026 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/59/Wendell_Vaughn_%28Realm_of_Kings%29_Quasar.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180426071026 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Wendell Vaughn (Realm of Kings) Quasar\" width=\"270\" height=\"298\" data-image-key=\"Wendell_Vaughn_%28Realm_of_Kings%29_Quasar.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Wendell Vaughn (Realm of Kings) Quasar.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Quasar (Marvel Comics), with the Quantum Bands, can store various ranges of electromagnetic energy including thermal radiation.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store thermal radiation.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb and store thermal radiation for later use</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Thermal Radiation Absorption\">Thermal Radiation Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Living Thermic Battery/Capacitance</li>\n<li>Thermal Radiation Storage/Containment</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb thermal radiation and store it for later use. They are able to use the stored energy for any purpose they see fit, channeling it however they please.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Attacks\" title=\"Electromagnetic Attacks\">Electromagnetic Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Infusion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Infusion\">Electromagnetic Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Attacks\" title=\"Heat Attacks\">Heat Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Infusion\" title=\"Heat Infusion\">Heat Infusion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Capacitor\" title=\"Electromagnetic Capacitor\">Electromagnetic Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Capacitor\" title=\"Gamma Capacitor\">Gamma Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Capacitor\" title=\"Heat Capacitor\">Heat Capacitor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Empowerment\" title=\"Electromagnetism Empowerment\">Electromagnetism Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Vision\" title=\"Electromagnetic Vision\">Electromagnetic Vision</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermoreception\" title=\"Thermoreception\">Thermoreception</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Empowerment\" title=\"Gamma Empowerment\">Gamma Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Empowerment\" title=\"Heat Empowerment\">Heat Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Gamma_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Gamma Radiation\">Personal Gamma Radiation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fire\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fire\">Personal Nuclear Fire</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Plasma_Fire\" title=\"Personal Plasma Fire\">Personal Plasma Fire</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Thermal Radiation Absorption\">Thermal Radiation Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermic_Accumulation\" title=\"Thermic Accumulation\">Thermic Accumulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThermic_Capacitor%3Fvea